WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.090
- I am Sal Khan, founder of the
not-for-profit Khan Academy.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.490
As you probably know,
we have a big mission,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.770
to provide a free world-class education

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.220
for anyone, anywhere.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.940
And we know that the most important people

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.000
in that mission are you, the teacher.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.560
And so that's why from the beginning,

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.670
Khan Academy has always
worked closely with teachers

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.860
to be able to create tools for teachers

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.680
so that they can use
it with their students

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.350
and allow the students' learning

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.450
to happen as well as possible.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.860
And so that's why we're excited

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.730
that you are a part of this training.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.860
Because I've always said, if I had to pick

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:44.190
between an amazing teacher
and amazing technology,

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.140
I would pick the amazing
teacher every time.

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:49.760
The good thing is we don't
have to make that trade-off.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.710
And so, here at Khan Academy,

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.380
we are trying to build tools for you,

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.440
tools that will make your life easier,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.120
that will save you time,

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.180
and will help you serve
your students better.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:05.870
- So Khan Academy is an online
educational set of resources.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.490
It is a combination of world-class content

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:14.490
that spans from kindergarten
all the way to 12th grade,

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.680
and in some cases, the first
and second year of college.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.313
And then we span across many subjects.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.170
There's two pieces that I
think makes it very unique.

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:31.420
One is not just world-class content,

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.890
but it's taught in a way that
is very easy to understand.

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.960
We also build a lot of what we call

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:41.000
social-emotional learning
elements into the platform.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.290
'Cause learning is hard.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:43.650
It can be intimidating.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.410
You could feel under-confident,

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.730
you could feel not very smart,

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.920
learning something that's very new to you.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.760
So our product of content and software,

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.600
the combination of both,

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.520
we try to make it so
it's easy to understand,

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.610
that it's fun, that's it's
engaging, that it motivates you,

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.630
that it helps build your self-confidence

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.320
so that you can start
to be a self-motivated,

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.150
independent learner, to
be a lifelong learner.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.680
And what makes us unique

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.200
is those elements of not just the content

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.210
but the social-emotional
learning part of the software,

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:19.360
as well as we have a lot
of built-in intelligence

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.470
to know exactly where you are

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.910
and all the steps that you need to learn.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.400
So we have this thing
called a Knowledge Map

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.677
inside our product that let's you say,

00:02:28.677 --> 00:02:31.177
"Gosh, if I wanna learn calculus some day,

00:02:31.177 --> 00:02:34.127
"I need to know these
foundational elements first,

00:02:34.127 --> 00:02:37.340
"and then I can build on
top," sort of like a house.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.700
We have the foundational elements,

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.150
and then you know how to
build the first story,

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.540
and then you put the second story,

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.590
and we connect all those dots for you.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.740
Our reach and our scale today,

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:49.780
we are in over 190
countries across the world.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:53.800
We are translated in over 30
languages across the world

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.740
by amazing advocates,
volunteers that help us do this

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.690
because they believe
so much in our mission.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:02.390
And it does really take a
village to make that happen.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.090
It is unfortunate there's a misconception

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:09.820
of us wanting to replace the teacher.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:10.653
Absolutely not.

00:03:10.653 --> 00:03:13.430
There is no way that we
can replace the teacher.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:16.430
They are such an important
part of the student's life.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.610
For us, it's about providing tools

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.700
and functionality for the teacher

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:24.000
to empower them, to give them agency,

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.110
to be better than they can ever be,

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:28.940
to be more efficient,
to be more effective.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:32.080
So tools and insights that we can do

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.320
to help the teacher so that they can

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.743
be the best that they can
be for these students.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.833
The people at Khan Academy are amazing.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:48.020
I am so blessed to run this company

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.940
because the people, I have 200 plus people

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:56.593
whose sole goal is to enable
this mission to happen.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:01.020
They just want to really
transform the educational industry

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.570
to really help those
under-served children.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:07.460
And that's what they eat,
breathe, and sleep, every day.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.500
- So we're excited that
you're part of this training.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.740
Hopefully, you will find everything

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:15.000
that we are able to provide
to you to be of use.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.820
And we are looking forward

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:19.460
to getting your feedback
about how together

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.980
we can better serve you and your students.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:23.813
Thank you.

